== Description ==

'''Spring''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 14 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[M1A]], [[M1891 01]], [[R870 01]], [[Firearm Kit]], [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Driver's Seat]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

